BT
/F1 10 Tf
11 TL
54 786 Td
(appeared on the Henitai repository.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Timeline) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Initial symptom characterization) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Reproduced the failure with narrow subjects and --jobs 1 --all-logs.) Tj
T*
(- Observed repeated timeouts and empty or unhelpful logs.) Tj
T*
(- Confirmed that No examples found. was not legitimate for the selected) Tj
T*
(  repo spec files.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Child-process instrumentation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Added gated child diagnostics under HENITAI_DEBUG_CHILD=1.) Tj
T*
(- Logged selected files, loaded-feature state, RSpec world example) Tj
T*
(  counts, and runner lifecycle markers.) Tj
T*
(- Used timeout-triggered child thread dumps to identify where the child) Tj
T*
(  was actually stalling.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Root-cause isolation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Confirmed that the execution problem was in RSpec boot and discovery,) Tj
T*
(  not in mutant activation.) Tj
T*
(- Reproduced the same stall in a direct subprocess outside the full) Tj
T*
(  mutation pipeline.) Tj
T*
(- Verified from thread dumps that) Tj
T*
(  RSpec::Core::Configuration#get_files_to_run and its directory scanning) Tj
T*
(  path were involved.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Architecture correction) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Restored the same-process mutant child contract for activated mutant) Tj
T*
(  execution.) Tj
T*
(- Reworked the baseline suite runner to use an explicit file list) Tj
T*
(  instead of plain Runner.run\(...\).) Tj
T*
(- Tightened classification for zero-example child runs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Smoke and test hardening) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Added a repo-level dogfood RSpec smoke path.) Tj
T*
(- Updated integration specs to test the real current runner shape) Tj
T*
(  instead of the old Runner.run\(...\) assumptions.) Tj
T*
(- Fixed Steep surface declarations for the new debug helper methods.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Root Cause) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Root Cause 1: Execution contract drift) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Henitai mutates code by injecting an activated method definition into a) Tj
T*
(live Ruby process. That means mutation activation is process-local by) Tj
T*
(design. The mutant must be activated and the tests must execute in the) Tj
T*
(same forked child.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The RSpec integration had drifted away from that contract. Once that) Tj
T*
(happened, debugging the later symptoms became harder because:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- some failures looked like timeouts) Tj
T*
(- some looked like No examples found.) Tj
T*
(- some were misclassified) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This was an architecture regression, not just a failing test.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Root Cause 2: Default RSpec discovery on a repo-scale codebase) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
