54 786 Td
(Henitai already knew which spec files it wanted to run. Despite that,) Tj
T*
(parts of the RSpec path still used default runner behavior that lets) Tj
T*
(RSpec discover files on its own.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(On the tiny smoke fixtures this was cheap enough to pass. On the Henitai) Tj
T*
(repository it triggered the slower discovery path and caused the) Tj
T*
(observed stalls.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The correct model for Henitai is:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.  decide the exact file list in Henitai) Tj
T*
(2.  seed RSpec with that file list explicitly) Tj
T*
(3.  load only those files) Tj
T*
(4.  run those example groups) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Not:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1.  hand control back to Runner.run\(...\)) Tj
T*
(2.  let RSpec rediscover the suite from the current working directory) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Contributing Factors) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Smoke suite too small) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The existing RSpec and Minitest smoke fixtures were real projects, but) Tj
T*
(they were toy-sized. They were good at checking that the end-to-end) Tj
T*
(pipeline was not completely broken. They were not good at exposing) Tj
T*
(repo-scale discovery cost or child-runner state problems.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Missing contract tests) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Some integration specs mocked or stubbed the old runner boundary and) Tj
T*
(therefore did not protect the actual invariant:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- mutation activation and test execution must share the same forked) Tj
T*
(  child) Tj
T*
(- zero-example child runs must not degrade into :survived or :timeout) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Weak initial diagnostics) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The original logs did not expose enough of the child lifecycle to) Tj
T*
(distinguish:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- hang in discovery) Tj
T*
(- hang in setup) Tj
T*
(- zero-example result) Tj
T*
(- compile error) Tj
T*
(- true timeout) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Test pollution in the spec suite) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(At least one updated RSpec unit example still invoked the real run_tests) Tj
T*
(path, which leaked behavior into later examples and caused unrelated) Tj
T*
(failures in integration specs for Minitest. That was fixed, but it) Tj
T*
(showed that the spec boundary itself had become too loose.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Why The Existing Smoke Tests Worked) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(They worked because they exercised the same code on much smaller) Tj
T*
(projects.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(That difference was enough to hide the bug:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- small fixture repos do not stress repo-scale file discovery) Tj
ET
endstream
