54 786 Td
(- their spec trees are tiny) Tj
T*
(- the cost of accidental default RSpec discovery stays low) Tj
T*
(- some child-runner state issues do not surface when the suite is) Tj
T*
(  trivial) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(So the smoke suite was not fake. It was simply not representative enough) Tj
T*
(for this failure mode.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Resolution) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The fix set had four parts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Restore the correct execution model) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- keep mutation activation and RSpec execution in the same forked child) Tj
T*
(- remove reliance on the invalid extra execution boundary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Bypass default discovery when Henitai already knows the file list) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- build and configure the RSpec runner directly) Tj
T*
(- set files_to_run explicitly) Tj
T*
(- call load_spec_files) Tj
T*
(- execute run_specs on the selected example groups) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Classify zero-example failures conservatively) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Zero-example child runs are now treated as :compile_error in the) Tj
T*
(relevant failure shapes instead of being allowed to drift into a) Tj
T*
(misleading status.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Strengthen regression coverage) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- added repo-level dogfood smoke coverage for the baseline RSpec path) Tj
T*
(- updated integration specs to match the real runner structure) Tj
T*
(- updated type signatures for the added debug helper surface) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(What Changed) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The principal corrective changes landed in:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- lib/henitai/integration.rb) Tj
T*
(- lib/henitai/scenario_execution_result.rb) Tj
T*
(- rakelib/integration_smoke.rake) Tj
T*
(- spec/henitai/integration/rspec_spec.rb) Tj
T*
(- spec/infra/integration_smoke_projects_spec.rb) Tj
T*
(- sig/henitai.rbs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Verification) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The fix was verified with:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- focused RSpec regressions for:) Tj
T*
(  - zero-example child classification) Tj
T*
(  - runner lifecycle logging) Tj
T*
(  - file-list setup before spec loading) Tj
T*
(- repo-level baseline smoke through smoke:dogfood_rspec) Tj
T*
(- bundle exec rake smoke:integration:all) Tj
T*
(- bundle exec steep check) Tj
T*
(- focused affected-area spec runs) Tj
T*
(- renewed mutation runs on the Henitai repository) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(At the end of the work:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- the smoke suite passed) Tj
