54 786 Td
(- Steep passed) Tj
T*
(- affected integration and classifier specs passed) Tj
T*
(- mutation runs on Henitai were running again) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Lessons Learned) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. The architecture contract must be executable) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If a design rule is essential, it needs a contract test. In this case:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- same-process mutant activation and test execution) Tj
T*
(- explicit file-list execution for RSpec) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. A tiny smoke suite is not enough) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Small real fixtures are still useful, but they are not a substitute for) Tj
T*
(one fast repo-level dogfood smoke that exercises the real execution) Tj
T*
(path.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Child diagnostics should be built in early) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mutation frameworks need strong child-process diagnostics because the) Tj
T*
(failure surface is wide:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- fork boundaries) Tj
T*
(- stdout/stderr capture) Tj
T*
(- framework boot) Tj
T*
(- suite discovery) Tj
T*
(- test hooks) Tj
T*
(- timeouts) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Misclassification is almost as bad as crashing) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A mutation-testing tool must not silently convert a runner failure into) Tj
T*
(a plausible but wrong mutant status. Wrong feedback is worse than loud) Tj
T*
(failure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Preventive Actions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Done) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Added a repo-level dogfood RSpec smoke path.) Tj
T*
(- Hardened zero-example classification.) Tj
T*
(- Updated integration tests to follow the real runner shape.) Tj
T*
(- Added debug lifecycle markers and timeout thread dumps.) Tj
T*
(- Declared the new debug surface in RBS.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommended Next) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Add a small repo-level mutant-child smoke, not only a baseline-suite) Tj
T*
(  smoke.) Tj
T*
(- Keep the dogfood smoke in CI as a required gate.) Tj
T*
(- Add an explicit regression around the ?same process? mutation) Tj
T*
(  activation contract.) Tj
T*
(- Treat unexpected zero-example runs as a named runner/discovery failure) Tj
T*
(  mode in reporting, not only as a conservative compile-error fallback.) Tj
T*
(- Clean up duplicated ScenarioLogSupport responsibilities in) Tj
T*
(  lib/henitai/integration.rb to make the integration easier to reason) Tj
T*
(  about.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Conclusion) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This incident was not a random flake. It exposed a real architectural) Tj
T*
(problem: Henitai had let RSpec execution drift away from the core) Tj
ET
